  "title-00": "Opening a burger restaurant in 8 months: the ultimate guide",
  "subtitle-hero-ebook-inner": "Follow our detailed, month-by-month action plan to successfully open your burger restaurant.",
  "name-value": "Ouvrir son restaurant de burgers en 8 mois : le guide ultime",
  "image-form-ebook-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67fbfb98edd00e47ff81db42_3%20couvertures%20magazine%20supperpos%C3%A9s%205.avif",
  "image-form-ebook-sizes": null,
  "image-form-ebook-srcset": null,
  "rt-thank-you-html": "\n                    <h2>Your guide is available 👇</h2>\n                    <p><strong>Thanks and happy reading!</strong></p>\n                    <p><a href=\"https://5696087.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5696087/Livres%20blancs/Ouvrir%20son%20restaurant%20de%20burgers.pdf\">Download the ultimate guide</a></p>\n                    <p>The <a href=\"/en\" target=\"_blank\">Innovorder</a> team</p>\n                  ",
  "rt-ebook-html": "\n              <p>+10 managers of major franchises from all horizons share their exclusive feedback and tips for success (BCHEF, Smash Smash, etc.).</p>\n            ",
  "temoignage-img-src": "",
  "temoignage-img-class": "temoignage-img w-dyn-bind-empty",
  "icon-ebook-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67c615431065ed12e961cb8c_Picto%20euro.png",
  "icon-ebook-sizes": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html": "\n            <p>How to <strong>finance your project:</strong> budget, minimum contribution, ...</p>\n          ",
  "icon-ebook-src-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65fcbb086273bdbcb3bd5407_Picto%20menu_Plan%20de%20travail%201%20copie%2021%201.avif",
  "icon-ebook-sizes-2": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset-2": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-2": "\n            <p>What are the <strong>essential steps</strong> to take: status, premises, registration, insurance, etc.?</p>\n          ",
  "icon-ebook-src-3": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/67c6154b7cdc2efa5688105d_IO%20Analytics%201.png",
  "icon-ebook-sizes-3": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset-3": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-3": "\n            <p>How to <strong>ensure</strong> your restaurant's long-term <strong data-wg-splitted>profitability</strong> from day 1</p>\n          ",
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-4": "\n          <p>In an ultra-competitive sector where new burger concepts spring up every week, getting into the restaurant business requires more than just a good idea. The reality is clear: 1 in 2 restaurants closes within the first 5 years.</p>\n          <p>To give you the best chance of success, we've put together a comprehensive, actionable guide, based on feedback from restaurateurs who have successfully launched their businesses.</p>\n        "
 }
